OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after motorbike crashes
OL,4,Ainto tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his sixties died after the
OL,7,Fmotorbike he was riding crashed into a
OL,8,Ftree.
OL,10,FThe collision, involving a black BMW
OL,11,Fmotorcycle, happened on the A4095 Upper
OL,12,FCampsfield Road, near Woodstock,
OL,13,FOxfordshire, at about 13:00 GMT on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FThe rider died at the scene and his
OL,17,Fnext of kin have been informed by
OL,18,FThames Valley Police.
OL,20,FThe force is urging anybody with more
OL,21,Finformation, or dash cam footage of the
OL,22,Fincident, to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
